	(text "J3 is the standard KiCad Bus_ISA_8bit symbol: pins 1-31 = B1-B31 (component side), pins 32-62 = A1-A31 (solder side).\nUnused bus pins are marked no-connect. Mounting bracket is a PCB/mechanical item (add footprint at layout)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 285 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "019aec01-edc8-4400-8901-2f531f8fa894")
	)
	(text "J2 jumper : pair  = address bit (1-2 = A15, 3-4 = A16, 5-6 = A17, 7-8 = A18)\nJumper IN = bit 0, jumper OUT = bit 1.\nC8000h : A18=1 A17=0 A16=0 A15=1 -> jumpers on 3-4 and 5-6\nD0000h : A18=1 A17=0 A16=1 A15=0 -> jumpers on 1-2 and 5-6\nD8000h : A18=1 A17=0 A16=1 A15=1 -> jumper on 5-6\nE0000h : A18=1 A17=1 A16=0 A15=0 -> jumpers on 1-2 and 3-4\nE8000h : A18=1 A17=1 A16=0 A15=1 -> jumper on 3-4\nA18=0 selects A0000-BFFFF (video) - do not use. C0000h is normally the video BIOS.\nWindow is 32K; avoid ranges used by video, HDD controller or other option ROMs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 245 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e6090b35-024e-480f-a2ff-35211f7420bd")
	)
	(text "XT-IDE ISA option ROM card (8-bit ISA, 27C256, 74LS688 decoder)\nROM is selected when A19..A15 match the jumper/pull-up levels, AEN=0 and /MEMR=0.\nA19 is hard-wired to match 1 (Q4 = +5V), so the window is always in 80000h-FFFFFh.\nRN1 pulls SEL_A15..A18 high; an installed jumper on J2 pulls that bit to 0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fd0a10a1-1568-4355-95a7-47631cb90c2c")
	)
